2. Components vendored by tgfx
================================================================================

This package ships no prebuilt binaries. tgfx and the components below are
distributed as source and are compiled into the tgfx static library by the
consuming app's own iOS or Android build.

2a. Fetched by tgfx's DEPS

cpp/third_party/tgfx/DEPS lists 21 repositories, which tgfx checks out into
cpp/third_party/tgfx/third_party/. Nothing under that directory is tracked by
git, so these sources are present in this package only when it is packed from
a checkout in which the DEPS sync has run.

