2b. Present in tgfx's source tree but NOT distributed

swiftshader and angle are committed under cpp/third_party/tgfx/vendor/, but that
directory is outside this package's files allowlist, so neither is published.
They are listed here only because tgfx's own LICENSE.txt covers them; this
package ships no part of either.

  swiftshader              Apache License 2.0 (not shipped)
  angle                    BSD 3-Clause — The ANGLE Project Authors (not shipped)

cpp/third_party/tgfx/LICENSE.txt reproduces the license terms for 18 of the
above: freetype, libpng, libwebp, pathkit, skcms, highway, libjpeg-turbo, zlib,
